BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Greater Orlando Volleyball Club] Summer Bash Coed Tournament (B/B
 B)
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260725T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260725T180000
UID:Greater_Orlando_Volleyball_Club-Summer_Bash_Coed_Tournament_(B/BB)-202
 6-07-25T09:00:00
DESCRIPTION:Summer Bash Tournament Details\n\nTournament Details\n\n- Date
 : July 25\, 2026\n- Time: 9:00 AM – 9:00 PM  - One division tournament 
 goes from 9am to 6pm \n- Two division tournament will be split 9am - 6pm 
 and 12pm - 9pm\n\n- Location: Dover Shores Community Center\n- 8 Player Ma
 x Roster\n- Iron Middles Allowed\nTRUE COED FORMAT - 3 Men + 3 Women on th
 e court at all times\nCome hang & have a good day\n\n- Free entry for anyo
 ne to come watch\n- Snacks and drinks provided for everyone \n- Lunch pro
 vided for players\nEntry & Prizes\n\n- $250 registration per team \n- $50
 0 cash prize for winner (subject to change with registration numbers) \n-
  Individual awards for group stage\n- Finals MVP award\nHow to Register\n\
 n- Team captains sign up your full team to secure your spot.\n- Spots are 
 limited and will fill quickly.\n\nSummer 2026\n\nMore info: https://goadul
 tsportsleague.leagueapps.com/app/tournaments/5018478
LOCATION:Dover Shores Community Center
URL:https://goadultsportsleague.leagueapps.com/app/tournaments/5018478
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Greater Orlando Volleyball Club] 2nd Annual Benefit Tournament
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260822T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260822T180000
UID:Greater_Orlando_Volleyball_Club-2nd_Annual_Benefit_Tournament-2026-08-
 22T09:00:00
DESCRIPTION:2nd Annual Benefit Tournament\nLast year\, our community came 
 together and raised over $3\,000 for the Dover Shores Community Center. We
 're back at it again — and this year\, every dollar goes toward two caus
 es: launching a youth volleyball program at DSCC and helping Rollins Club 
 Volleyball fund their season.\n\nWays to Give\n- Play in the tournament 
 — register your team and compete all day.\n- Eat at Southern Fowl — gr
 ab a meal any time on tournament day\, save your receipts\, and let them k
 now you're with Greater Orlando Volleyball.\n- Buy a shirt — orders must
  be placed by August 11.\n- Shop the on-site vendors at Dover Shores — $
 1 from every order goes to the cause.\n- Donate before the event — and c
 heck whether your employer offers donation matching to double your impact.
 \n- Donate at the event — any donation over $5 earns you a free snack pa
 ss.\n\nTournament Details\n- Date: August 22\, 2026\n- Time: 9:00 AM – 9
 :00 PM\n- Location: Dover Shores Community Center\n- Roster: 8 players max
 \n- Iron middles allowed\n- Pool play + playoffs guaranteed\n\nDivisions\n
 - GOLD Division — morning session\n- SILVER Division — evening session
 \n- 8 teams max per division\n- If we don't get 6+ teams in each division\
 , we'll collapse divisions for pool play and run separate GOLD and SILVER 
 brackets for the playoffs.\n\nEntry & Prizes\n- $300 per team | $100 from 
 every entry donated directly to the causes\n- Individual awards for the gr
 oup stage\n- Finals MVP award\n- Both division winners receive free enroll
 ment in their next tournament\n\nHow to Register\nTeam captains\, sign up 
 your full team to secure your spot. Spots are limited and will fill quickl
 y.\n\nSummer 2026\n\nMore info: https://goadultsportsleague.leagueapps.com
 /app/tournaments/5018502
LOCATION:Dover Shores Community Center
URL:https://goadultsportsleague.leagueapps.com/app/tournaments/5018502
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Greater Orlando Volleyball Club] Saturday Indoor Volleyball Leagu
 e - Summer
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260613T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260613T210000
UID:Greater_Orlando_Volleyball_Club-Saturday_Indoor_Volleyball_League_-_Su
 mmer-2026-06-13T17:00:00
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Greater Orlando Volleyball’s Summer Indoor League
 \n\nWe’re back for another season of indoor league play at Dover Shores 
 — built for intermediate+ players who want real competition with that so
 cial GOVB energy.\n\nLeague Format - 6v6 teams (coed optional)\n- Rosters:
  7–9 players (we recommend 8)\n- Two matches per week\; best of three\n-
  Sets played to 25\, 25\, 15  (50-minute matches)\n- USAV rules with refs
  (teams provide officials)\nPrice - $60 early bird\, $70 regular\, $80 lat
 e\n- Payment plans available\nLeague Perks - League t-shirt (Week 2/3\, sp
 onsorship dependent)\n- Championship shirts + medals\n- End of season part
 y \nSeason Schedule - June 13 — Open Gym + Team Practice\n- June 20 - W
 eek 1\n- Championship Week: August 15th\n- June: 13\, 20\, 27\n- July: 11\
 , 18\, 25\n- August: 1\, 8\, 15\nDivisions - One coed division\n- Men’s 
 height net\n- Intermediate level required\nFree Agents Sign up solo and we
 ’ll place you on a team. If we can’t\, you’ll get a full refund.\n\n
 Subs - Outside subs: must be invited + pay single-day fee\n- League player
 s can sub freely\n- No subs on Championship Week\nSee you on the court.\nG
 reater Orlando Volleyball\n\nSummer 2026\n\nMore info: https://goadultspor
 tsleague.leagueapps.com/leagues/volleyball-(indoor)/4968685-saturday-indoo
 r-volleyball-league---summer
LOCATION:Dover Shores Community Center
URL:https://goadultsportsleague.leagueapps.com/leagues/volleyball-(indoor)
 /4968685-saturday-indoor-volleyball-league---summer
END:VEVENT
