DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Greater Orlando Volleyball's Fall Women's League We
 're back at Dover Shores for a season of Sunday women's indoor league play
 \, built for players who want real competition with that social GOVB energ
 y.\n\nLeague Format - 6v6 women's teams\n- Rosters: 7+\, no cap (we recomm
 end 8)\n- At least four sets each week\n- Sets played to 21\, 21\, 15 (50-
 minute matches)\n- USAV rules with refs (teams provide officials)\nPrice -
  $65 early bird\, $70 regular\, $75 late\n- Payment plans available\nLeagu
 e Perks - League t-shirt (Week 2/3\, sponsorship dependent)\n- Championshi
 p shirts + medals\n- End of season party\nSeason Schedule - September 13 
 — Week 1\n- October 25 — Championship Week\n- September: 13\, 20\, 27\
 n- October: 4\, 11\, 18\, 25\nDivisions - One women's division\n- Women's 
 height net\n- Intermediate level required\nFree Agents Playing without a t
 eam? Come to Women's Open Gym on Sundays in August — August 2\, 9\, 16\,
  and 23. That's where teams get built\, and it's the best way to find a ro
 ster before registration fills. Our leagues generally fill quickly and we 
 rarely have room for a full free agent team.\n\nYou can find those session
 s here: https://goadultsportsleague.leagueapps.com/classes/5064743-open-gy
 m---summer-series\n\nSubs - Outside subs: must be invited + pay single-day
  fee\n- League players can sub freely\n- No subs on Championship Week\nSee
  you on the court\,\nGreater Orlando Volleyball\n\nSummer 2026\n\nMore inf
